WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.813
A field from Milnor K-theory.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.746
Degree one and two data should pin

3
00:00:04.746 --> 00:00:06.692
down the field. Uniqueness is in Lean.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.323
Products that vanish trace out lines, and lines rebuild the field.

5
